Subject: [PATCH] Keep Microsoft broker headers on both sign-in steps (#260)

Based on Wyze3306's native-webview fix, commit
1a8e00e1bccc837558f1d09aff345416e3b82728 in BedrockOnLinux:
https://github.com/Wyze3306/BedrockOnLinux/blob/f976cd557c49cd20aae4245761c43d08d2efe54e/third_party/xodus/patches/0004-login-host-the-second-leg-of-a-sign-in-like-the-first.patch
Adapted for Nexus's stdio transport, with shared native/headless regression tests.
No changes to token exchange, credentials, request URLs or browser trust policy.

